{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04578","headline":"岳州行郡竹篱 · 张说","name":"岳州行郡竹篱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山郡不沟郭，荒居无翳壅。\n爱人忠主利，善守闭爲勇。\n苟非小勤瘁，安得期逸宠。\n版筑恐土疎，襄城嫌役重。\n藩栅聊可固，筠篁近易奉。\n差池截浦沙，缭绕缘隈壠。\n矗似长云亘，森如高戟耸。\n预绝豺狼忧，知免牛羊恐。\n闾里宽矫步，榛丛恣踏踵。\n始果游处心，终日成闲拱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}